{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humanity Echo</strong> is a turn-based tactical <strong>RPG/CRPG</strong> in a <strong>cyberpunk</strong> world where <strong>your choices shape the city of the future</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>rotting seaside megacity</strong> is locked in a <strong>filthy war for freedom</strong>, while <strong>corporate overlords play god</strong>\u00a0- your fate a decision, your life a resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now choose: live as their puppet, or become the hero who writes a new chapter. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/3e3c3fc6066b9d7a72161aae2ab3d494.poster.avif?t=1759434647\" width=840 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/3e3c3fc6066b9d7a72161aae2ab3d494.webm?t=1759434647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/3e3c3fc6066b9d7a72161aae2ab3d494.mp4?t=1759434647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Add to wishlist - this directly helps the release and increases the visibility of the game on Steam.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/3dcb2084b6e2b2312310d0f8f5ad681e.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based tactics:</strong> cover, line-of-sight, <strong>Action Point (AP) management</strong>, class interplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classes &amp; customization:</strong> roles, perks, attributes, flexible gear loadouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Implants &amp; mods:</strong> upgrade body and weapons, <strong>prototype designs in your workshop</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich:</strong> your decisions reshape characters, districts, and the balance of power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk locations:</strong> slums, rebel safehouses, corporate factories, and <strong>secret-ridden catacombs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive events:</strong> situations force <strong>hard choices</strong>\u00a0- spend resources, betray allies, or risk your life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/85ef4a544b244a45bf1560f37c6250b5.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat rewards focus:</strong> positioning, angles, timing, and exit routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional tools</strong> unlock unconventional plays: <strong>mark targets</strong> and <strong>disrupt enemy coordination</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build toward your style</strong> with implants, modules, and gear. <strong>Choose</strong> what matters more: <strong>tactile feel</strong> or <strong>tactical edge</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/309388d3f1b406a907f2e471edcdaab9.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop:</strong> cobalt-chrome, controllers, wiring, and advanced polymers become <strong>mods and implants</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt rare components</strong> via contracts, trading, and <strong>salvage and dismantling</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Implant software</strong> affects stability, perks, and side effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/43881a0645b3140d968865380c985a4a.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks set the pace:</strong> sprinter, tank, sniper, <strong>demolitionist</strong>, medic, scout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attributes</strong> (reflex, vitality, perception, tech) amplify your chosen role.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow</strong> across several paths, but you can\u2019t be the best at everything.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/75c3f3c89e75beabf4f896db54c94dcb.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your father\u2019s disappearance</strong> unearths old secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Resistance</strong>, <strong>the Order of Knights</strong>, and <strong>corporations</strong> pull you into their games. <strong>You decide</strong> whom to trust and what to risk; the whole city will feel the consequences.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/390c3a7c3b234ece21f2f0df506bf8f9.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rooftop with chill music. Harbor warehouses. A panoramic boulevard. <strong>Underground catacombs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the city lies <strong>Mirror Lake</strong> near <strong>Kreid-Wall</strong>. Old tech bays hide under the ice, and <strong>border scanners and checks</strong> can alter your route.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/a4e887bd3748054f714bab4220f2e0b0.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are an indie team from Ukraine</strong>, in love with <strong>tactical gameplay</strong> and a <strong>human-centered future</strong>. Beyond the neon there\u2019s <strong>humor, food, and music</strong> - the small things that make a city feel like home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step by step,</strong> we\u2019re moving toward deeper immersion with micro-interactions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/7d1b7791aa484bc586490738655d4ed6.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft 2.0:</strong> more implants, technologies, and real material dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic encounters:</strong> higher variety and replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party base:</strong> personal rooms, workbenches, and upgrades that affect missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New stories &amp; districts:</strong> the port, the Dark Quarter, the panoramic boulevard, and more. <i>(roadmap evolves with the community)</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/extras/36a7bd9923c298c799a68365cd57b9c1.avif?t=1759434647\" width=667 height=91 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The city glows in neon</strong> and <strong>listens to your choice</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like the vibe? Add<strong> Humanity Echo </strong>to your<strong> Wishlist</strong> and visit the <strong>Community Hub</strong> via the links on the store page - together we set the priorities for upcoming builds.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865080?t=1759434647","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865080?t=1759434647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/9e42b61f6d7df81d4de2aead906125f72edf9f10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759434647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865080/9e42b61f6d7df81d4de2aead906125f72edf9f10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759434647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3941550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humanity Echo</strong> is a turn-based tactical <strong>RPG/CRPG</strong> in a <strong>cyberpunk</strong> world where <strong>your choices shape the city of the future</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>rotting seaside megacity</strong> is locked in a <strong>filthy war for freedom</strong>, while <strong>corporate overlords play god</strong>\u00a0- your fate a decision, your life a resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now choose: live as their puppet, or become the hero who writes a new chapter. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn